  "description": "For as long as he can remember, Chaemin’s been an unlucky guy. But he’s also learned that there’s nothing he can do but pull himself up by his bootstraps and do the best with what he’s got… until he’s hit by a truck and dies. Or at least that’s what Chaemin thought when he was rudely awakened by a grim reaper who, to Chaemin’s surprise, decides they’re willing to give him a second chance at life! All Chaemin has to do for the soap-opera-loving reaper is make a “happy ending” with his fated partner, Cheon Woojoo. But Woojoo is the one guy Chaemin just can’t stand. How is he supposed to turn this hateful situation… into a fated one? \n\n(Source: Lezhin US)",
